{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802390/extras/b320adbaeb16cab0f523df5035f99139.poster.avif?t=1757339655\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802390/extras/b320adbaeb16cab0f523df5035f99139.webm?t=1757339655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802390/extras/b320adbaeb16cab0f523df5035f99139.mp4?t=1757339655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nerds and Ammo is a first\u2011person puzzle platformer where husband\u2011and\u2011wife scientists, Dr. Isaac Screwit and Dr. Roxy Volt, are suddenly trapped inside their own high\u2011tech laboratory after an unexpected security lockdown. With the facility\u2019s AI behaving\u2026 oddly, each room transforms into a physics\u2011based puzzle chamber packed with unpredictable hazards and bizarre contraptions. Armed with your trusty SCIENCE CANNON \u2014 a non\u2011lethal launcher that fires an arsenal of quirky projectiles to manipulate the environment \u2014 you\u2019ll bounce, trigger, and outwit your way through increasingly devious challenges to escape before the lab\u2019s chaos consumes you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3802390?t=1757339655","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802390/5f1dea32e1b105bef2a1bbaea470c7ced007b5d8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757339655","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802390/40704a664ddb250eb856ec974628a4df3d25a688/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757339655","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802390/40704a664ddb250eb856ec974628a4df3d25a688/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757339655","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802390/extras/b320adbaeb16cab0f523df5035f99139.poster.avif?t=1757339655\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802390/extras/b320adbaeb16cab0f523df5035f99139.webm?t=1757339655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802390/extras/b320adbaeb16cab0f523df5035f99139.mp4?t=1757339655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nerds and Ammo is a first\u2011person puzzle platformer where husband\u2011and\u2011wife scientists, Dr. Isaac Screwit and Dr. Roxy Volt, are suddenly trapped inside their own high\u2011tech laboratory after an unexpected security lockdown. With the facility\u2019s AI behaving\u2026 oddly, each room transforms into a physics\u2011based puzzle chamber packed with unpredictable hazards and bizarre contraptions. Armed with your trusty SCIENCE CANNON \u2014 a non\u2011lethal launcher that fires an arsenal of quirky projectiles to manipulate the environment \u2014 you\u2019ll bounce, trigger, and outwit your way through increasingly devious challenges to escape before the lab\u2019s chaos consumes you.</p>","developers":["Dennis Harper"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.aka